#: 01-evernight.qml:18
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Evernight Vista New User Guide"
msgstr "Evernight Vista 新手指南"

#: 01-evernight.qml:19
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"The following tools can help you get started quickly and enhance your system "
"experience."
msgstr "以下工具可帮助您快速上手并提升系统使用体验。"

#: 01-evernight.qml:42
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "About Evernight Vista"
msgstr "关于Evernight Vista"

#: 01-evernight.qml:74
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Nvidia Driver Manager"
msgstr "NVIDIA 驱动管理器"

#: 01-evernight.qml:80
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you have an NVIDIA graphics card, use the NVIDIA Driver Manager to "
"install drivers. The Evernight Vista kernel can recognize most hardware "
"drivers, and these drivers can work automatically without installing extra "
"drivers, but NVIDIA drivers need proprietary ones to work properly or to get "
"better performance."
msgstr ""
"如果您拥有 NVIDIA 显卡，请使用 NVIDIA 驱动管理器来安装驱动。Evernight Vista "
"内核能够识别大多数硬件驱动，这些驱动无需额外安装即可自动工作，但 NVIDIA 驱动"
"需要专有驱动才能正常工作或获得更佳性能。"

#: 01-evernight.qml:87 01-evernight.qml:130 01-evernight.qml:173
#: 01-evernight.qml:216
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "启动"

#: 01-evernight.qml:117
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Install Software & Update System"
msgstr "安装软件与更新系统"

#: 01-evernight.qml:123
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Miryu Software Center can provide security updates, feature updates, and "
"kernel updates for the Evernight Vista operating system, helping to maintain "
"its security, boost performance, and add support for new hardware. In "
"addition, you can also install software from flatpak and linyaps in the "
"Miryu Software Center."
msgstr ""
"Miryu 软件中心可为 Evernight Vista 操作系统提供安全更新、功能更新和内核更新，"
"有助于维护系统安全、提升性能并增加对新硬件的支持。此外，您还可以在 Miryu 软件"
"中心中从 Flatpak 和玲珑安装软件。"

#: 01-evernight.qml:160
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "系统设置"

#: 01-evernight.qml:166
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Open the KDE system settings, and you can set up your Evernight Vista "
"operating system your way, like configuring peripherals and appearance."
msgstr ""
"打开 KDE 系统设置，您可以按自己的方式配置 Evernight Vista 操作系统，例如配置"
"外设和外观。"

#: 01-evernight.qml:203
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Btrfs Assistant"
msgstr "Btrfs 助手"

#: 01-evernight.qml:209
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Using the Btrfs assistant to set up Snapper and create Btrfs snapshots can "
"help you easily roll back the system in case of problems after updating or "
"other issues."
msgstr ""
"使用 Btrfs 助手配置 Snapper 并创建 Btrfs 快照，有助于在更新后或因其他问题导致"
"故障时轻松回滚系统。"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:28
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "About Evernight Vista"
msgstr "关于Evernight Vista"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:44
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "What is Evernight Vista?"
msgstr "什么是Evernight Vista?"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:53
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Evernight Vista is a Linux distribution built on Fedora, for every beginner "
"and global user."
msgstr "Evernight Vista基于Fedora，为每一个新手和全球用户而打造的Linux发行版"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:63
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Related Links"
msgstr "相关链接"

#: 02-about-evernight.qml:80
